  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Peace Fund Strategy from 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPF is a multi-donor trust fund aiming to mitigate the impact of armed conflict in Myanmar and to engage in processes that contribute to an inclusive, long-term, and peaceful conflict resolution. It has established a broad portfolio of projects which reflect the JPF&apos;s holistic approach to supporting peace in Myanma. This includes projects aimed at empowering women and gender-diverse persons to advance meaningful and equitable participation in conflict prevention; peace negotiations; peacebuilding; and post-conflict reconstruction and governance.</narrative>
  </description>
